    "sections": {
        "description": "Spa Centric is a lightweight and elegant WordPress theme crafted with block patterns, making it perfect for wellness-focused businesses seeking a modern, responsive design. Its customizable layout and soothing aesthetics make it an ideal choice for spas, salons, yoga studios, beauty clinics, massage centers, meditation retreats, nail bars, hair studios, holistic healing centers, aromatherapy services, wellness resorts, acupuncture clinics, skincare studios, fitness clubs, nutritionists, health coaches, pilates studios, chiropractic clinics, herbal therapy centers, float spas, and luxury bathhouses. With its intuitive design and user-friendly features, Spa Centric ensures a professional online presence tailored to businesses in the wellness and relaxation industry."
    },
